infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Outbox relay: polling vs Debezium CDC
  compares
    - label Poll-based relay
      children
        - label 1-5s lag
          desc Latency equals the poll interval
        - label No extra infra
          desc Just queries unpublished outbox rows
        - label Polling load
          desc Repeated scans of the outbox table
    - label Debezium CDC relay
      children
        - label Sub-second lag
          desc Tails the Postgres write-ahead log
        - label No polling
          desc Publishes the instant the row commits
        - label Production standard
          desc Default for high-throughput services
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6
